ompiles or downloads on the build platform), signs t\n- **Deploy.** A deploy job verifies the signature and the revision label, checks the new commit descends from the pinned one, and pins the digest and commit in the deployment repository. Argo CD renders this repository's `deploy/argocd` chart (the app of apps) with that pin and the site's values: on\n- **Release.** An annotated tag `vX.Y.Z` (`git tag -a`) builds that commit with `VERSION=vX.Y.Z`, pushes `:vX.Y.Z` and moves `:latest` when it is the highest version. Release tags are annotated because Jenkins builds only tags at most a day old and dates a lightweight tag by its commit, so a lightwe\n- **Kill switch in a cluster.** `kubectl -n <namespace> exec deploy/ard-<instance> -- touch /home/ard/.ard/pause/<owner>/<repo>` pauses `ard serve`; `rm` resumes.\n\n- A `Dockerfile` builds the role's image; without one the local executor runs a \n-rwxr-xr-x@ 1 al  staff  7305 Nov 24 13:45 deploy/test-image.sh","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1f055458-edd7-4d37-90f5-92083b2f6320","uuid":"05ddfd11-0f0b-4494-92c5-1a94dfedf388","timestamp":"2026-11-24T12:46:04.660Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"FROM ${GO_IMAGE}\nARG VERSION=dev\nARG REVISION=unknown\nCOPY --from=build /out/ard /usr/local/bin/ard\nCOPY --from=build /out/govulncheck /usr/local/bin/govulncheck\nCOPY --from=tools /out/osv-scanner /usr/local/bin/osv-scanner\nCOPY --from=tools /out/jq /usr/local/bin/jq\nCOPY --from=tools /out/tini /usr/local/bin/tini\n# HOME is the pod's PVC (~/.ard state, the repo clone, Go caches). TMPDIR is\n# exec-capable for the cve scan's toolchain downloads. GOTOOLCHAIN=local: the\n# scan switches toolchains itself.\nENV HOME=/home/ard \\\n    TMPDIR=/var/tmp \\\n    GOTOOLCHAIN=local\nUSER 65532:65532\nLABEL org.opencontainers.image.source=\"https://github.com/albertcbrown/ard\" \\\n      org.opencontainers.image.revision=\"${REVISION}\" \\\n      org.opencontainers.image.version=\"${VERSION}\" \\\n      org.op